{"id":"548e36d75578d019","group":"90","path":"90/90-df-ce-set.md","title":"Computably Enumerable Sets","display":"df-ce-set — Computably Enumerable Sets","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference","book_abbrev":"90","label":"90-df-ce-set","aliases":["90-df-ce-set"],"display":"df-ce-set — Computably Enumerable Sets","depends_on":["[[90-df-recursive-function-class]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"90"},{"key":"label","html":"90-df-ce-set"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>90-df-ce-set</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-ce-set — Computably Enumerable Sets"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"137d75d038de4a47\" href=\"?note=137d75d038de4a47\" title=\"90-df-recursive-function-class\">90-df-recursive-function-class</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span>。一元部分函数的输入按原一元组识别取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N\">\\(\\mathbb N\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PartRec}_1\">\\(\\operatorname{PartRec}_1\\)</span> 取机器可计算函数类。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CE}\">\\(\\mathrm{CE}\\)</span> 是集合上的一元谓词，不包含补集也可枚举的要求；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{CE}\">\\(\\mathcal{CE}\\)</span> 是满足该谓词的集合类。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PartRec}_1\">\\(\\mathrm{PartRec}_1\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"137d75d038de4a47\" href=\"?note=137d75d038de4a47\" title=\"90-df-recursive-function-class\">90-df-recursive-function-class</a> 的一元部分递归函数类，与上述 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PartRec}_1\">\\(\\operatorname{PartRec}_1\\)</span> 为同一接口。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{CE}(A)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\land\n\\exists f\\in\\mathrm{PartRec}_1\\ \\operatorname{dom}(f)=A,\\\\\n\\mathcal{CE}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{A\\subseteq\\mathbb N:\\mathrm{CE}(A)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{CE}(A)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\land\n\\exists f\\in\\mathrm{PartRec}_1\\ \\operatorname{dom}(f)=A,\\\\\n\\mathcal{CE}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{A\\subseteq\\mathbb N:\\mathrm{CE}(A)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本文件依据第 90 本实际调用的接口补齐未提供的外部依赖，供本书内部使用；不声称复原未提供的外部原文。 这是数值集合接口。原 RE 谓词文件仍负责任意元数关系的编码表达，不将所有关系默认为一元集合。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"90-df-recursive-function-class","status":"resolved","id":"137d75d038de4a47","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-recursive-function-class]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-recursive-function-class","status":"resolved","id":"137d75d038de4a47","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PartRec}_1$ 使用 [[90-df-recursive-function-class]] 的一元部分递归函数类，与上述 $\\operatorname{PartRec}_1$ 为同一接口。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{PartRec}_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CE}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal{CE}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PartRec}_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{PartRec}_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{CE}(A)&\\Longleftrightarrow A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\land\n\\exists f\\in\\mathrm{PartRec}_1\\ \\operatorname{dom}(f)=A,\\\\\n\\mathcal{CE}&\\coloneqq\\{A\\subseteq\\mathbb N:\\mathrm{CE}(A)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1276,"backlinks":[{"id":"b88a00a8db9c1c07","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CE}(A)$ 与 $\\mathcal{CE}$ 使用 [[90-df-ce-set]] 的数值集合可枚举性谓词及其集合类，参数 $A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$。"},{"id":"40041a5a5d6a4573","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CE}(C)$ (computably-enumerable-set predicate, see [[90-df-ce-set]])"},{"id":"002c574215686062","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$T$ 是句子公理集，$\\operatorname{Ax}(T)=T$，推理规则固定为 [[90-df-predicate-logic]] 的 $\\mathcal R_T=\\mathrm{Rules}_{\\mathrm{FOL}}$；$\\mathrm{CE}$ 取 [[90-df-ce-set]] 的可枚举集合谓词。"},{"id":"7eb380164954dfb8","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"fcd465e3faf82dc1","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CE}$ (computably enumerable set predicate, see [[90-df-ce-set]])"},{"id":"1316be710802d6a1","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"下文一元比较使用 [[90-df-ce-set]] 的 $\\mathrm{CE}$；$W_e$ 使用 [[90-df-program-numbering]] 的实际程序定义域，覆盖性见 [[90-lem-program-numbering]]。"},{"id":"10ddd9c20c6edffd","anchor":"ref-17","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[90-df-ce-set]]"},{"id":"32c1f47762a7f658","anchor":"ref-168","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[90-df-acceptable-program-numbering.md]]\n[[90-df-atomic-formula.md]]\n[[90-df-base-formula.md]]\n[[90-df-base-free-variable.md]]\n[[90-df-base-godel-numbering.md]]\n[[90-df-ce-indexing.md]]\n[[90-df-ce-set.md]]\n[[90-df-computable-function.md]]\n[[90-df-encoding.md]]\n[[90-df-hilbert-bernays.md]]\n[[90-df-iota-operator.md]]\n[[90-df-language.md]]\n[[90-df-many-o